B.aE_=new A.aE(B.aF7,["Created {count} records","Record {number} (select to revise)","Segment {index} was skipped: {reason}","Try telling me what to record","Tap the microphone and say the phrase below. If voice input is unavailable, use the sample button.","Lunch today, 90 dollars, paid in cash","Use practice phrase","Review the parsed record","Check the date, type, title, amount, and payment method, then tap Create record.","Learn edit protection",'Saving an edited record requires the exact word "Edit". Use the button to practice it now.',"Practice typing \u201cEdit\u201d","Delete the practice record",'Deletion requires the exact word "Delete". The practice record will then be removed from the database.',"Delete practice record","Practice record deleted. The tutorial is complete!","Type","Voice","Import ICS calendar","Add events from Google Calendar or another calendar","Health & travel","Medication, packing, and trip lists","Medication reminders","Add medication course","Travel plans","Import ICS calendar","Choose an .ics file exported by Google Calendar or another calendar. It is parsed only on this device and added to worCat after confirmation.","Choose an ICS file","Selected: {file}","{ready} ready, {duplicate} duplicates, {skipped} skipped","{count} more events will also be imported","{count} import notices","Add events","Imported {count} ICS events","Imported {count}; a later event failed: {error}","Could not parse the ICS file: {error}","The ICS file is over 10 MB. Split it before importing.","No importable events were found in this ICS file.","worCat Work Calendar","Switch language","\u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587","English (US)","Cat name settings","Cat friend features","Mew language settings","Privacy and data","View privacy and data notice","Download my data","Your member data was downloaded. Please store the file securely.","Direct download is unavailable on this platform. Please use the Web PWA.","Data download failed: {error}","Historical backups","Historical backups","Archived yearly data is read-only and is merged with current cloud data when needed.","Archive your {year} data?","worCat will save that year of ledger entries, schedules, work logs, and tasks as a local JSON archive on this device.","July 1 is the final archive day. On July 2, the prior year cloud data is deleted under the retention policy.","Create yearly backups automatically","This preference is stored separately on each device.","Later","Archive now","The yearly backup was created and downloaded.","The yearly backup is stored on this device. Download a separate JSON copy from Historical backups.","Yearly backup failed: {error}","Local yearly archives are unsupported on this platform.","This device has no yearly backups yet.","{year} archive","{count} records \xb7 {state}","Cloud copy removed; using this local backup","Cloud copy retained; backup is not duplicated","Download JSON","The yearly JSON backup was downloaded.","Backup download is unavailable here.","Delete local backup","Delete the {year} backup?","This backup contains {count} archived records. Enter your current member password to confirm deletion.","Only the local backup on this device will be deleted. Supabase data, other devices, and downloaded JSON files are not affected. If the cloud copy was already removed, this device will no longer show that year.","Current member password","Enter your current member password.","Delete backup","The {year} local backup was deleted from this device.","Backup deletion failed: {error}","Import yearly JSON backup","Imported the {year} backup.","Backup import failed: {error}","Browser storage can be removed with the PWA or site data. Keep a separately downloaded JSON file. It contains personal data and is not encrypted, so do not share it publicly.","Archived \xb7 read-only","Review how your data is used","Read the privacy policy, retention period, sharing rules, and data download notice before registering.","Read privacy and data notice","Privacy and data notice read","I agree to the privacy, data retention, and sharing rules","Read and agree to the privacy and data notice before creating an account.","worCat privacy and data notice","Policy version: {version}","Please read the following notice in full. Registering confirms that you understand how your data is retained, shared, and downloaded.","1. Data collected and purpose","The system processes your email, nickname, assistant name, ledger entries, schedules, work logs, tasks, notification settings, push-device information, and usage estimate for sign-in, cross-device sync, records, reminders, and friend sharing that you enable. Passwords are handled by Supabase Auth; worCat does not store passwords in application tables or exported files.","2. Retention and deletion","From January 1 through July 1 each year, worCat asks you to archive the prior calendar year of ledger entries, schedules, work logs, and tasks on the current device. On July 2, the prior year cloud data is deleted whether or not it was archived. Archived records are read-only and are merged into the app after the cloud copy is removed. Browser archives are separate on each device and can be lost when the PWA or site data is removed, so keep a separately downloaded JSON file. Completed push-notification records are retained for no more than 30 days. Deleting an account removes the main application data and clears sign-in state and cache on this device, but JSON files you downloaded remain your responsibility.","3. Friend sharing and consent","Sharing is off by default. A friend can read only the categories you explicitly allow after a relationship is created or accepted, and cannot edit or delete your records. You can revoke access or remove a friend at any time; invitation notices expire after 3 hours. Data shared with you by other members is excluded from your download.","4. Data download and portability","After signing in, you can download a JSON file containing your account identifiers, ledger entries, schedules, work logs, tasks, notification settings, and usage summary. The file excludes passwords, authentication tokens, server keys, and other members data.","5. Third-party services and security","worCat uses Supabase for authentication, database, and server functions, and browser push services for reminders you enable. Data is processed only as needed for these features and is not sold to third parties.","Scroll to the end before confirming that you have read this notice.","I have read the full notice",'Scroll to the end, then select "I have read the full notice".',"Close","Make this recurring","Set it once and worCat will create future records automatically.","Repeat frequency","Daily","Every few days","A day of each month","Every {days} days","Day interval","Day of month","Day {day} of each month","Starts: {date}","Set an end date","When should this recurrence end?","Until fully paid","This recurring expense is paid","Included in expenses and applied to the linked payable.","Not counted as an expense until you confirm the payment.","Payment pending","Mark as paid","An occurrence is still created on the end date.","No end date, until manually stopped","End date","From the 15th of each month, records for the next month are prepared. Days 29 to 31 use the last day in shorter months.","Recurring items","Recurring item management","Stop or resume at any time. Finite rules leave after their end date; stopped unlimited rules leave after their final generated date.","No recurring items yet. Enable recurrence while adding a ledger entry, schedule, or task.","Ledger","Schedule","Work task","{start} to {end}","Creating automatically","Stopped","Could not update recurring item: {error}","Delete recurrence","Delete this recurring item?","This stops future creation and removes pre-created items from tomorrow onward. Today and earlier records stay available.","Recurring item deleted","Could not delete recurring item: {error}","Recurring","Supabase connected","Local demo mode","Cancel","Save","Retry","Save entry","Save event","Save log","Save task","Processing...","Updating...","Action failed: {error}","Version {version}","Updated on {date}","A new version is ready, meow!","A newer Android version is available. Update to continue with the latest features.","Installed: {version}","Latest: {version}","What's new","Later","Update now","The update page could not be opened. Please try again later.","Release notes","Updates from the latest 10 versions","View release notes","Reminder voice","Reminder voice style","Each Android device can use its own setting. A short meow plays first, followed by the reminder in the selected voice style.","Meow only","Play the short cat sound without reading the reminder","Standard reminder","Use the system voice at its standard pitch and speed","Cute kitten","A slightly higher and slower voice style","Energetic reminder","A faster voice style for important schedules","Gentle reminder","A slower and softer voice style","Preview","You have a schedule starting soon, meow.","Reminder voice style saved.","The reminder voice setting could not be saved.","Unread release notes are available","Latest","Got it","Show update details","Hide update details","Cat friend QR corner","Cat friend exchange corner","Meet through a one-time QR, then choose what each cat friend may view.","My cat friend QR","Scan friend QR","My cat friends","Ledger","Schedule","Work tracking","Choose what you will share with a new cat friend, then create a one-time QR.","Create a cat friend QR","Choose at least one item to share, meow.","Expires: {time}","You may share a screenshot. The QR expires after the first request is sent, and the owner has 3 hours to respond.","Copy friend code","The cat friend code is ready to share.","Use the camera, select an image, or paste a code to read a worCat friend QR.","The camera is unavailable, meow. Allow camera access or use an image or pasted code.","Paste cat friend code","Meet this cat friend","This is not a valid worCat friend QR, meow.","This is your own cat friend QR, meow. Ask another member to scan it.","Send a cat friend request to {name}?","Their QR offers to share","Choose what you will share with them","Send friend request","You are cat friends now, meow!","The request is waiting in their notifications. They have 3 hours to respond.","No cat friends yet, meow. Scan a QR to send the first request.","I share with them","They share with me","Save permissions","Sharing permissions updated.","Select this cat friend directly from the Information Hub to show their shared content.","Remove cat friend","Remove this cat friend?","Both members will immediately lose access to all shared information.","Cat friend connection removed.","Sharing is not enabled yet. Run the member-sharing migration in Supabase.","Sharing action failed: {error}","Shared information is view-only and cannot be edited or deleted.","Looking for cat friend data...","Cat friend requests","A cat friend is waiting for your reply","Cat friend requests","Requests remain available for 3 hours, so remember to reply in time.","No cat friends are knocking right now, meow.","{name} wants to become cat friends!","Reply before {time}. This request expires after that time.","They would share with you","You offered to share when creating the QR","Not right now","Become cat friends","You are cat friends now, meow!","This invitation was politely declined.","Read QR from image","The image is decoded only on this device and is never uploaded.","No recognizable worCat QR code was found in this image.","The image is too large. Select an image under 12 MB.","Could not read this image: {error}","View shared info","Shared by {name}","There is no shared information to display.","Shared ledger","Shared schedule","Shared work logs","Shared tasks","Back to this month","Open related page","Open and expand this record","Skip tour","Next stop","Start using worCat","Stop {current} of {total}","Overview station","See monthly cashflow, upcoming schedules, and work records. Use an arrow to open the related page.","Week and month calendar","Swipe between periods, tap a date for its agenda, or expand the full month from the top right.","Ledger summary","Review income, expenses, advances, and balance. Arrows take you to the matching filtered list.","Ledger list","Switch months or categories here. Expand a record to review, edit, or delete its details.","Schedule summary","See monthly schedules, work events, and the next event. Arrows lead directly to the schedule list.","Schedule list","Switch months and expand an event to review reminders, locations, participants, and more.","Work tracking summary","Quickly review this month\u2019s logs, task count, and the currently selected Gantt month.","Work logs","Record completed work and hours, then expand a log to review or adjust its details.","Work Gantt chart","Review task periods and progress by month, and update task status directly below the chart.","No linked task","NT$","Email","Calendar","Ledger","Schedule","Work Tracking","Member menu","Signed out.","Account","Change cat nickname","Set your cat nickname","Cat friends see this nickname, and every nickname can belong to only one member.","Cat nickname","Enter 2\u201324 characters","Check nickname","Check that this nickname is available first.","Nickname availability checks automatically after 3 seconds.","Checking this nickname...","Nickname check failed. Edit the name and try again.","This nickname is available, meow!","Another cat friend already uses this nickname.","Save nickname","Nickname updated, meow!","Use 2\u201324 characters and do not include line breaks.","Nicknames are not enabled yet. Run the member-nicknames migration in Supabase.","Change password","Sign out","Password","New password","Confirm new password","Password must be at least 6 characters","The passwords do not match","Failed to update password: {error}","Change password","Update password","Please enter your email","Please enter your password","Member account","Supports sign-up, sign-in, and email verification.","Password management","Forgotten password and reset flows return you directly to the app.","Separated member data","Each member keeps an independent calendar, ledger, schedule, and work log.","Sign in to worCat Work Calendar","Create a new worCat account","Send a password reset email","Set a new sign-in password","Bring your work rhythm, logs, and calendar back into one cat-themed workspace.","Create one account and carry your data across different platforms.","Enter your email and we will send a reset link back to worCat.","After verifying the email, set your new password right here.","Member sign in","Create account","Forgot password","Set new password","Enter your email and password to return to your personal worCat workspace.","After registration, email verification may be required depending on your Supabase settings.","Enter your email and we will send a reset link back to this app.","Enter a new password and finish the update.","You are currently setting a new password for {email}.","Sign in","Create member account","Send reset email","Update password","Back to sign in","Create account","Forgot password","Email verified","Your account has been verified. You can now sign in and sync your personal data.","The account {email} has been verified. You can now sign in and sync your personal data.","Enter app","Go to sign in","Signed in successfully.","Account created and signed in.",u.b,"Password reset email sent. Please open the link from your inbox.","Password updated","Your new password has been saved. Please sign in again with the new password.","Password updated.","Password reset verified","Enter and submit your new password to sign in again.","Set new password","Reset link expired","Reset link unavailable","This password reset link has expired or has already been used. Please request a new one.","The app could not verify this password reset link. Please request a new one.","Verification link expired","Email verification failed","This verification link has expired or has already been used. Please sign up again or request a new verification email.","The app could not complete email verification. Please reopen the latest link from your email.","Verification failed","The app cannot complete password recovery verification right now. Please request another reset email.","The app cannot complete email verification right now. Please try again later.","Back to sign-in page","Syncing member data","Loading your work calendar, ledger, schedule, and work logs. Please wait a moment.","Failed to load data","The app could not read member data. Please confirm that your Supabase tables and policies are ready.","Ledger entry added.","Schedule event added to the calendar.","Work log saved.","Task added to the Gantt chart.","Calendar planner","Tap a date to view its records. Ask the cat helper to add ledger entries, events, work logs, or tasks.","Tap a date to open its daily timeline.","Week {week} of this month","Show full month","Collapse to one week","Previous week","Next week","{count} record(s) on this day","Scheduled","Other records","All day","Ends {time}","Whose information should we show?","Show yourself and multiple cat friends together without changing sharing permissions.","Just me","Ledger","Schedule","Work log","Selected date","Summary for {date}","Net flow {value}","No cashflow yet","{count} task(s) fall on today","This day is still empty","There are no records for this day. Call the cat helper to add one.","Work event","Task date range","Drag a range on the calendar or select a single date as the due date.","Clear range","After selecting a date, manually add a task from the cat helper to use this range.","This range will fill the task start and due dates when you add it from the cat helper.","Create task","Drag on the calendar","Select a date range, then manually add a multi-day task from the cat helper.","Integrated Info Hub","Tap a date to view combined records, and call the cat helper whenever you want to add something.","The app is currently in demo mode. Fill in your Supabase URL and Anon Key to connect this whole workflow to Supabase.","Add ledger","Add schedule","Add work log","Monthly income {value}","Monthly expense {value}","Monthly income","See it next to expenses on the same calendar","Monthly expense","See cash flow at a glance","Monthly schedules","{count} entries","Work and personal events stay together","Monthly work logs","{count} logs","Progress and blockers live side by side","Ledger entry added.","Finance cat helper","Let a cat help sort your daily cash flow","This page gathers monthly income, expenses, and balance so your ledger feels more like a vivid little worCat wallet than a plain spreadsheet.","Monthly income {value}","Monthly expense {value}","Monthly income","Total of all incoming cash","Monthly expense","Total of all spending","Monthly balance","You are still in the positive","Expenses are higher than income","Cash flow meter","Month","Half-year","Year","Jan-Jun {year}","Jul-Dec {year}","{year}","Balance","Other currency totals","Different currencies are not converted or added together.","Currency","Ledger list","Review every entry by month, quickly backfill records, or revisit your spending habits.","No ledger entries this month","Call the cat helper to add your first entry and organize the numbers.","Schedule added.","Scheduling cat assistant","Give every calendar slot a better rhythm","Whether it is a personal plan or a work event, worCat helps you keep this month's moments, places, and participants clear.","{count} schedule entries this month","{count} work event(s)","Add schedule","Monthly schedules","Everything planned for this month","Work events","Can link directly to tasks and the Gantt chart","Next upcoming event","Nothing scheduled yet","Start by planning something new","Starts at {datetime}","Schedule list","Review all schedules for this month. Linked task progress for work events also appears here.","No schedules this month","Call the cat helper to add your first event and bring the calendar to life.","Linked task: {title} ({range})","Work log added.","Task added.","Work logs","Capture what you completed, how many hours it took, and what got stuck so each day has a clearer rhythm.","Add log","No work logs this month","Call the cat helper to record what you finished today.","Work Gantt chart","Review task spans and progress by month, then use the cat helper to create tasks from selected ranges.","Add task","Year","Month","Month {month}","Adjust progress","Updated progress for {title}.","Work cat planning hub","Keep logs, task progress, and the Gantt chart in the same rhythm","This page focuses on your work. What you completed today, where you got blocked, and what comes next all stay visible beside task progress.","{count} logs this month","{count} tasks this month","Monthly logs","Records of output and reflection","Gantt tasks","Tasks currently in focus","Current Gantt month","Switch year and month to browse","Blockers: {value}","Next step: {value}","Current progress {value}%","Add ledger entry","Add schedule","Add work log","Add work task","Date","Type","Item name","Please enter a ledger item","Category","Other","Amount","Currency","Please enter a valid amount","Payment method","Cash","Note","Schedule name","Please enter a schedule name","General","Location","Participants","This is a work event","Create a linked Gantt task too","Expected due date","Owner","Me","The end time must be after the start time","Start time","End time","Title","Please enter a title","What did you finish today?","Please enter the work content","Hours spent","Blockers","Next step","Related work task","Start date","Due date","Task name","Please enter a task name","Status","Details","Initial progress: {value}%","No work tasks for this month","Select a calendar range, then call the cat helper to add a task and start your Gantt chart.","Expense","Income","Not started","In progress","Done","Blocked","No member is signed in, so Supabase data cannot be used.","Me","July shipping schedule cleanup","Confirm suppliers, packaging, and delivery windows.","Material restock","Procurement","Bank transfer","Restock plastic bags and label paper.","Client final payment","Sales","Wire transfer","Final payment for the June project.","Weekly check-in and delivery review","Meeting","Meeting Room A","Internal team","Confirm the work breakdown and timeline risks.","Morning requirement breakdown finished","Split July priorities into four trackable work blocks.","Waiting for the supplier delivery timeline.","Add the Gantt chart and ledger fields this afternoon.","This cat is still fetching pictures","Please wait a moment, cat friends~","Loaded {loaded}/{total}","Failed to prepare images","Some workspace images could not be loaded yet. Please try again.","A new version {version} is available. Updating now..."],t.l)
